    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so... simulated lately. like i'm just staring at a screen even when my eyes are open. i look at people on the street and they feel like low-res textures or just lines of code moving through a loop. i don't feel solid anymore. i feel like i'm just a glitch in the system that's taking up space it shouldn't be.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
